 \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e2fbd5d0f684bb95ef2b126d00ab87cb11b4d94e91ab9ea80aaca03a421e9be1","event_uuid":"7faf111d-e505-4c5a-b5c5-43876c6f0411","position":{"commit_sha":"22e24882a96e46b926eed1e747110e7454bbe5f1","position":"1784447045131639001-7faf111d-e505-4c5a-b5c5-43876c6f0411"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-215_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"7e896944-eea2-4c6c-a857-bd17dad2ef90","comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Landed via Gerrit change 823 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/823), submitted as commit 5f2d31a55 on origin/main with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 (0 unresolved comments). The three specs now each carry a balanced gold_set (finding+pass entries): plan-review-asserted-capability (6 entries), plan-review-decomp-shape (4), plan-review-necessity (4). Local strict validation: validate_eval_spec(spec, strict=True) returns no errors for all 21 dataset-bearing packaged specs. Prompt Eval action run 29678395138 for commit 5f2d31a55 concluded success (offline eval-discipline green).","timestamp":1784446861158561001}],"created_at":1784445466218590001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Reproduction Steps\n\nThe `prompt-eval` GitHub Actions workflow runs the offline eval-discipline gate over every\npackaged eval spec: it loads each `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml` and calls\n`rebar.llm.evals.eval.validate_eval_spec(spec, strict=True)` for any dataset-bearing spec,\nasserting no errors.\n\n1. On `origin/main`, run the strict validator over the packaged specs (or push any commit and\n   watch the `Prompt Eval` action).\n2. Three advisory plan-review probe specs added 2026-07-18 carry a `dataset` but no `gold_set`:\n   `plan-review-asserted-capability.eval.yaml` (d08f34847), `plan-review-decomp-shape.eval.yaml`\n   (ce1989cb1), and `plan-review-necessity.eval.yaml` (cbc5b2880).\n3. Strict validation returns `['strict: eval spec needs a non-empty gold_set (judge kappa alignment)']`;\n   the CI step asserts and exits 1 -> the `prompt-eval` job is red on main. (The assert names only\n   the first offender in glob order, decomp-shape, but all three are non-compliant.)\n\n**Expected:** every packaged dataset-bearing eval spec passes strict validation; `prompt-eval` green.\n**Actual:** the three specs above fail strict validation for a missing `gold_set`.\n\nThis is the same defect class as bug 1e80 (plan-review-g7), which was fixed the same way.\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly the three eval spec YAML files. Add a non-empty, balanced `gold_set` of `{input, label}`\nhuman-gold entries (label in `finding`/`pass`) to each, mirroring each spec's existing dataset\nscenarios and the convention used by `plan-review-container.eval.yaml`. No code changes.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Each of the three specs has a non-empty `gold_set`; each entry has an `input` and a `label` (`finding`|`pass`).\n- [ ] Each gold_set is balanced (>=1 `finding` and >=1 `pass` gold label), faithful to that spec's dataset.\n- [ ] `validate_eval_spec(spec, strict=True)` returns no errors for all dataset-bearing packaged specs.\n- [ ] The offline eval-discipline test suite passes; the `Prompt Eval` action is green.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"1d77155c-0a29-45f0-b8dd-6625203d34c9","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d37b-1cc2-9e94-4bea","ticket_type":"bug","title":"prompt-eval CI red on main: three advisory plan-review specs missing gold_set","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["3c8f82f0-3de7-4d03-adac-3a6ca9f26719","5511b6de-6cd2-4e5a-80d4-7f0e3a69a09e","8576572a-238c-4477-ab20-dcd431f1ccec","6dde5ea6-bc5f-4370-9832-e8e1c3fbc3f3","1d77155c-0a29-45f0-b8dd-6625203d34c9","7faf111d-e505-4c5a-b5c5-43876c6f0411"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659675002047001,"uuid":"155d98cb-f2ac-4bb4-bd47-d95d8138e8cd"}